{"title":"Dead members of Congress can’t stop tweeting","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/dead-members-of-congress-cant-stop","date":1751295799000,"content":"<div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9HOO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c62eac-db5e-446c-8094-10986d6771a5_1024x683.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9HOO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c62eac-db5e-446c-8094-10986d6771a5_1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"490\" height=\"326.826171875\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9HOO!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c62eac-db5e-446c-8094-10986d6771a5_1024x683.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9HOO!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c62eac-db5e-446c-8094-10986d6771a5_1024x683.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9HOO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c62eac-db5e-446c-8094-10986d6771a5_1024x683.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9HOO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c62eac-db5e-446c-8094-10986d6771a5_1024x683.jpeg 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>Rep. Gerry Connolly passed away in May</figcaption></figure></div><p>Dead members of Congress <a href=\"https://www.politico.com/news/2025/06/28/dead-lawmakers-social-media-00429884\">can’t stop posting online.</a> Accounts for recently deceased lawmakers have continued to post on social media, highlighting how little official policy there is for how to handle their online presence after they die.</p><p>POLITICO <a href=\"https://www.politico.com/news/2025/06/28/dead-lawmakers-social-media-00429884\">reports</a>:</p><blockquote><p>After Zohran Mamdani’s apparent victory in the New York Democratic mayoral primary on Tuesday, former Rep. Sheila Jackson Lee (D-Texas) liked an Instagram post congratulating him on his win. </p><p>The only problem — Jackson Lee died last July.</p><p>From ghost-likes and new profile pictures to a posthumous endorsement, accounts for dead lawmakers have seemingly resurrected on social media in an unsettling trend of beyond-the-grave engagement.</p><p>Rep. Sylvester Turner, a Democrat who filled Lee’s Texas seat for a brief two months before his own passing in March 2025, appeared to change his profile picture on X three weeks after he died…</p><p>Former Rep. Gerry Connolly, a Virginia Democrat who died in May, has also continued to make waves from beyond the grave, as his political social media accounts chugged back to life to notify followers that early voting had begun in the race to fill his vacant seat…</p><p>An account for political activist, brief 2012 GOP presidential primary leader and staunch Trump supporter Herman Cain resurfaced two weeks after he died in July 2020 from a weekslong battle with Covid-19. The account <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/technology/2020/08/31/herman-cain-twitter-account/\">posted attacks</a> at then-presidential candidate Joe Biden and pro-Trump content — as well as conspiracy theories about the virus that had taken Cain’s own life…</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>How to handle the social media presence of politicians when they die is a fairly new phenomenon. If a member of the House dies, for example, their office often remains open to fulfill constituent services — and sometimes continues posting to social media, albeit not typically under the lawmaker’s name. And there’s even less clarity around lawmakers’ social media accounts that they use for campaigning, as opposed to official work.</p><p>Zack Brown, who was the communications director for Rep. Don Young (R-Alaska) when he died in office in March 2022, said there is no official process for handing off control of lawmakers’ social media accounts if they die while still serving. That leaves communications staff in an awkward bind on how to proceed with languishing accounts, he said.</p><p>Although there were content rules on what staff members were allowed to post to Young’s accounts — political, policy-related and ideological posts were off-limits — there was no guidance on what to do with the accounts themselves.</p><p>“When a member of Congress dies, nobody seems to care about getting the log-ins from you, or assuming control of the Facebook page,” Brown said. “I still, if I wanted to, could go post to Facebook as Congressman Young — I could still tweet today as Congressman Young. And nobody from archives or records or from House administration, or anybody, seems to give a shit.”</p><p>Brown continued serving in the Alaskan’s office for four months after his death, administering the affairs of the office and helping wind down its operations to prepare for Young’s replacement after the special election.</p><p>While the process of physically closing down Young’s office was “meticulous,” with individual files and knickknacks from the lawmaker’s office requiring logging, the “digital aspect of it was completely ignored,” Brown said. Brown noted that failing to properly administer a lawmaker’s social media presence is also a constituent services issue, as many people reach out to their representative’s offices via direct message for assistance.</p></blockquote><p><a href=\"https://www.politico.com/news/2025/06/28/dead-lawmakers-social-media-00429884\">Read the full story here</a>.</p><div><div><div><p>User Mag is a reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, become a free or paid subscriber.</p></div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\" width=\"1407\" height=\"27\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><h2>A fun NYC event: Garbage Day Live</h2><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d_iT!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F28ccad18-5939-455b-80e7-4bb844273b8d_1292x666.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d_iT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F28ccad18-5939-455b-80e7-4bb844273b8d_1292x666.png\" width=\"1292\" height=\"666\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d_iT!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F28ccad18-5939-455b-80e7-4bb844273b8d_1292x666.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d_iT!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F28ccad18-5939-455b-80e7-4bb844273b8d_1292x666.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d_iT!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F28ccad18-5939-455b-80e7-4bb844273b8d_1292x666.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d_iT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F28ccad18-5939-455b-80e7-4bb844273b8d_1292x666.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Garbage Day (an awesome newsletter run by my friend Ryan Broderick) is doing a three-night residency live show at <strong>Baby’s All Right</strong> in Brooklyn this July. Tickets are officially on sale and each night has a different theme and different guests. On night one will be internet reporting icon <strong>Kat Tenbarge</strong>. Night two will be <strong>Peter</strong> <strong>McIndoe</strong>, the genius behind Birds Aren’t Real, and night three will be <strong>Akilah Hughes</strong>. You can grab tickets for each night by clicking the links below!</p><ul><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://wl.seetickets.us/event/garbage-day/650288?afflky=BabysAllRightBrooklyn&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=just-the-regular-kind-of-authoritarian-purge\">July 8 — “The Masculinity Crisis”</a></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://wl.seetickets.us/event/garbage-day/650291?afflky=BabysAllRightBrooklyn&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=just-the-regular-kind-of-authoritarian-purge\">July 15 — “Silicon Valley Ate The World”</a></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://wl.seetickets.us/event/garbage-day/650292?afflky=BabysAllRightBrooklyn&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=just-the-regular-kind-of-authoritarian-purge\">July 22 — “America Is Doomed”</a></strong></p></li></ul><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\" width=\"1407\" height=\"27\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><h2>What I’m reading</h2><div></div><p><strong>The Mysterious Billionaire Behind the OnlyFans Porn Empire</strong> </p><p>Leo Radvinsky is asking as much as $8 billion for the platform he popularized for sex workers and others producing explicit content, even as he personally avoids the spotlight. - <em><a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/business/media/only-fans-leonid-radvinsky-profile-706c914d\">Wall Street Journal</a></em></p><p><strong>The Monster Inside ChatGPT</strong></p><p>WSJ discovered how easily a model’s safety training falls off, and below that mask is a lot of darkness. - <em><a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/opinion/the-monster-inside-chatgpt-safety-training-ai-alignment-796ac9d3\">The Wall Street Journal</a></em></p><p><strong>A.I. Is Homogenizing Our Thoughts</strong></p><p>Recent studies suggest that tools such as ChatGPT make our brains less active and our writing less original. - <em><a href=\"https://www.newyorker.com/culture/infinite-scroll/ai-is-homogenizing-our-thoughts\">The New Yorker</a></em></p><p><strong>The OnlyFans Stars Sleeping With Hundreds of Men a Day</strong></p><p>Extreme sex challenges are becoming more popular. Call it rage-bait porn. - <em><a href=\"https://www.vulture.com/article/bonnie-blue-lily-phillips-annie-knight-interview-onlyfans.html\">Vulture</a></em></p><p><strong>The Concorde-and-Caviar Era of Condé Nast, When Magazines Ruled the Earth</strong></p><p>Opulent days are over at Vogue, Vanity Fair and other once-powerful glossies. Anna Wintour is giving up (some) control. Now that everyone’s a gatekeeper, why do we keep recreating their status-obsessed world? - <em><a href=\"https://archive.is/2025.06.28-030410/https://www.nytimes.com/2025/06/27/business/media/conde-nast-magazines-vogue-vanity-fair.html\">The New York Times</a></em></p><p><strong>Mel Gibson and Republicans call Trump a 'Daddy.' Here's why</strong></p><p>Once you understand Strict Father Morality, you understand Republican politics. - <em><a href=\"https://www.theframelab.org/daddy-issues-why-mel-gibson-republicans-frame-trump-as-a-father-figure/\">FrameLab</a></em></p><p><strong>The Grim State of Trans Health Care</strong></p><p>With the “Big Beautiful Bill” in flux, and federal funds for gender-affirming care hanging in the balance, protections for trans children and adults continue to be dismantled at the state level. - <em><a href=\"https://www.newyorker.com/news/the-lede/the-grim-state-of-trans-health-care\">The New Yorker</a></em></p><p><strong>RSVP SOS</strong></p><p>Partiful, Apple Invites, Paperless Post: How online invitations became a splintered mess. - <em><a href=\"https://archive.ph/2025.06.30-022515/https://www.businessinsider.com/online-invite-industry-booming-partiful-weddings-apple-hosts-guests-mad-2025-6\">Business Insider</a></em></p><p><strong>Does your Instagram grid still matter?</strong></p><p>A short history of the Instagram grid and a look at whether it still matters, featuring thoughts from social media manager Bonnie Azoulay and pop culture creator Hannah Zook. - <em><a href=\"https://www.phonetime.news/p/does-your-instagram-grid-still-matter\">Phone Time</a></em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/dead-members-of-congress-cant-stop?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxMTMxMTk5NywicG9zdF9pZCI6MTY2ODY2ODg5LCJpYXQiOjE3NTM3MzMzNzQsImV4cCI6MTc1NjMyNTM3NCwiaXNzIjoicHViLTMyMzgiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.3t_OtGuq--1ov7weuRRYvKC8mlmkwOGVGextTu1zrhE\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>User Mag news rundown </h2><ul><li><p>The New York Times is <a href=\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/business/business-news/nyt-cooking-new-video-shows-veggie-baking-show-1236300697/\">seeking cooking YouTubers and other online content creators</a> to make video content for NYT Cooking. </p></li><li><p>Yale is teaching a <a href=\"https://www.readfeedme.com/p/yale-is-teaching-a-course-for-substack\">course on writing</a> for Substack.</p></li><li><p>Instagram DMs <a href=\"https://archive.ph/1V4u0\">are the new Raya</a>. </p></li><li><p>Far right <a href=\"https://archive.ph/1MtNv#selection-1525.7-1525.19\">YouTuber Brett Cooper</a> is now a Fox News contributor.</p></li><li><p>Original Blue’s Clues host Steve Burns is <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=71bDllC5OyA\">starting a podcast</a>. </p></li><li><p>Walton Goggins is <a href=\"https://www.the-independent.com/life-style/walton-goggins-white-lotus-jimmy-johns-audiobook-smut-b2778186.html\">narrating a ‘smut’ audiobook for Jimmy Johns</a>. </p></li><li><p>ICE is using <a href=\"https://www.404media.co/ice-is-using-a-new-facial-recognition-app-to-identify-people-leaked-emails-show/\">a new app that can identify</a> anyone by simply pointing a smartphone camera at their face.</p></li><li><p>If your Labubu doll has more than nine teeth, or if it came in a box with a shiny bright finish, it may not be a Labubu at all. <a href=\"https://archive.ph/B4LY9#selection-4453.0-4457.130\">It may be a “Lafufu.”</a></p></li><li><p>An AI-generated psych-rock band called the Velvet Sundown <a href=\"https://www.stereogum.com/2313501/ai-generated-psych-rock-band-the-velvet-sundown-rack-up-hundreds-of-thousands-of-spotify-streams/news/\">is racking up hundreds of thousands</a> of Spotify streams.</p></li></ul><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xNR0!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F934f9609-72cd-4b6e-a410-507eed17593a_1562x910.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xNR0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F934f9609-72cd-4b6e-a410-507eed17593a_1562x910.png\" width=\"368\" height=\"214.32967032967034\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xNR0!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F934f9609-72cd-4b6e-a410-507eed17593a_1562x910.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xNR0!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F934f9609-72cd-4b6e-a410-507eed17593a_1562x910.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xNR0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F934f9609-72cd-4b6e-a410-507eed17593a_1562x910.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xNR0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F934f9609-72cd-4b6e-a410-507eed17593a_1562x910.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a><figcaption>The Velvet Sundown is a fully AI generated band</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><p>A neo-Nazi white supremacist newsletter called <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/historycanthide/p/i-am-the-1-rising-history-newsletter?r=9ce09&amp;utm_medium=ios\">The White Rabbit</a> climbed to the #2 Rising History Newsletter spot on Substack last week with 7.6K subscribers.</p><ul><li><p>Their bio reads: \"NAME THE JEW! We must secure the existence of our people and a future for White children. 14/88\" </p></li></ul></li><li><p>Trump is <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/694828/trump-mobile-t1-phone-made-not-in-the-usa\">no longer claiming</a> that his gold Trump phones will be made in the USA. </p></li><li><p>Marketers are <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/articles/madison-avenue-lands-a-bigger-role-in-hollywood-b37e3c44\">pushing for brands to appear more in movies and TV shows</a>, and entertainment execs are caving. </p></li><li><p>Anna Wintour is stepping down as editor-in-chief of <a href=\"https://nypost.com/2025/06/26/media/anna-wintour-steps-down-from-vogue-after-37-years-reports/\">Vogue after 37</a> years.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://deadline.com/2025/06/glastonbury-bbc-kneecap-bob-vylan-live-free-palestine-chant-1236445211/\">British artist Bob Vylan</a> chanted \"Free Palestine\" and \"Death, death to the IDF\" at Glastonbury, which was aired live on the BBC. The phrase trended on Twitter and people are making videos using the audio on social media to highlight Israel’s war crimes. </p></li><li><p>The BBC refused to broadcast Irish band Kneecap’s Glastonbury set due to their pro-Palestine activism, so <a href=\"https://www.belfasttelegraph.co.uk/news/northern-ireland/helen-from-wales-hailed-hero-of-free-speech-after-live-stream-of-kneecap-reaches-2-million/a322661459.html\">“Helen From Wales” streamed the entire thing on TikTok</a> and raked up millions of views. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Pbx!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9b31e74d-5bc3-44ad-81bc-9e1779a95c4a_1155x700.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Pbx!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9b31e74d-5bc3-44ad-81bc-9e1779a95c4a_1155x700.jpeg\" width=\"492\" height=\"298.1818181818182\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Pbx!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9b31e74d-5bc3-44ad-81bc-9e1779a95c4a_1155x700.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Pbx!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9b31e74d-5bc3-44ad-81bc-9e1779a95c4a_1155x700.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Pbx!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9b31e74d-5bc3-44ad-81bc-9e1779a95c4a_1155x700.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Pbx!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9b31e74d-5bc3-44ad-81bc-9e1779a95c4a_1155x700.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p>Ramy Youssef <a href=\"https://archive.ph/2025.06.29-184208/https://www.vulture.com/article/ramy-youssef-zohran-mamdani-mahmoud-khalil-surprise-appearance.html\">brought Zohran Mamdani and Mahmoud Khalil</a> out on stage at his NYC show this weekend. </p></li><li><p>Jake Paul spent $39 million to buy <a href=\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/money/personalfinance/real-estate/2025/06/27/jake-paul-39-million-georgia-southlands/84393261007/\">a 5,746 acre plantation</a> in Bainbridge, Georgia.</p></li><li><p>Everyone is <a href=\"https://archive.ph/4Bfwg\">spitting in each other's</a> mouths these days.</p></li><li><p>Chinese president Xi Jinping warned citizens that Labubu dolls are <a href=\"https://x.com/toxxygen/status/1938157451058229643?t=PRHneTX5Ui3LmzYxxRG0mA&amp;s=19\">for playing and</a> not for financial speculation.</p></li><li><p>Labubu-maker Pop Mart is <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/china/labubu-maker-pop-mart-diversifies-into-jewellery-with-new-concept-store-2025-06-13/?\">venturing into jewelry</a>. </p></li><li><p>After MrBeast <a href=\"https://x.com/MrBeast/status/1938410924253274473\">pulled his AI generated thumbnail app</a> due to backlash, a vibe coder released <a href=\"https://x.com/levelsio/status/1938968739908632844?t=tB2DaSTmnzdpRntp7YUEBQ&amp;s=19\">an almost exact clone</a>. </p></li><li><p>A British man travelled all the way to Pakistan to chase down <a href=\"https://x.com/PicturesFoIder/status/1939253419845263410?t=mpbh1_NBBViPeOTLr6GZXw&amp;s=33\">his stolen AirPods</a>. </p></li><li><p>The Trader Joe's in Silver Lake has painted over a <a href=\"https://www.joeyscott.xyz/erasing-tragedy-mely-corado-trader-joes/\">mural painting honoring</a> Mely Corado, who was shot and killed by the LAPD in 2018.</p></li><li><p>Tiny Chef, an animated kids show that was <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/tv-movies/tiny-chef-creators-reveal-why-nickelodeon-canceled-beloved-show-despite-emmy-win-3220458/\">suddenly cancelled by Nickelodeon after winning multiple Emmys</a>, has raised nearly $100,000 after going viral. </p></li><li><p>TikTok and Instagram are working on versions of their apps customized to <a href=\"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/tiktok-instagram-plot-tv-apps-following-youtubes-success\">run on TV screens</a> following YouTube's success in the living room.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u4yX!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda621218-c0fc-4fe1-89f8-4889865f62db_1179x1152.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u4yX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda621218-c0fc-4fe1-89f8-4889865f62db_1179x1152.jpeg\" width=\"377\" height=\"368.36641221374043\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u4yX!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda621218-c0fc-4fe1-89f8-4889865f62db_1179x1152.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u4yX!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda621218-c0fc-4fe1-89f8-4889865f62db_1179x1152.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u4yX!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda621218-c0fc-4fe1-89f8-4889865f62db_1179x1152.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!u4yX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda621218-c0fc-4fe1-89f8-4889865f62db_1179x1152.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p><span></span>’s newsletter The Soft Core is making me want <a href=\"https://mollyrosen.substack.com/p/soft-core-summer-dispatch-greetings\">a soft core summer</a>, relaxing in Hudson Valley and eating fresh cherries. </p></li><li><p>Google launched Doppl, a new app that <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2025/06/26/google-launches-doppl-a-new-app-that-lets-you-visualize-how-an-outfit-might-look-on-you/\">lets you visualize</a> how an outfit might look on you.</p></li><li><p>The Trump administration is building a national <a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2025/06/29/nx-s1-5409608/citizenship-trump-privacy-voting-database\">citizenship data system</a>.</p></li><li><p>Elon Musk is <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/elon-musk-x-twitter-hashtags-ban-ads\">banning hashtags</a> from ads on Twitter.</p></li><li><p>Social platforms like Reddit and Pinterest are <a href=\"https://www.modernretail.co/marketing/social-platforms-like-reddit-and-pinterest-are-striking-more-retail-media-partnerships\">striking more retail media partnerships</a>.</p></li><li><p>The Chan-Zuckerbergs stopped funding social causes. <a href=\"https://www.msn.com/en-us/health/other/ar-AA1HD0XI\">400 kids lost their school.</a></p></li><li><p>Over 70 top authors release an open letter asking Penguin, HarperCollins, and other US publishers to <a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2025/06/28/nx-s1-5449166/authors-publishers-ai-letter\">refrain from publishing books</a> written using AI tools.</p></li></ul><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/dead-members-of-congress-cant-stop?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxMTMxMTk5NywicG9zdF9pZCI6MTY2ODY2ODg5LCJpYXQiOjE3NTM3MzMzNzQsImV4cCI6MTc1NjMyNTM3NCwiaXNzIjoicHViLTMyMzgiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.3t_OtGuq--1ov7weuRRYvKC8mlmkwOGVGextTu1zrhE\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>Good posts</h2><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Aot!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02f17312-1726-4bff-90ff-9d9bedb628d6_1179x413.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Aot!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02f17312-1726-4bff-90ff-9d9bedb628d6_1179x413.jpeg\" width=\"567\" height=\"198.61832061068702\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Aot!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02f17312-1726-4bff-90ff-9d9bedb628d6_1179x413.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Aot!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02f17312-1726-4bff-90ff-9d9bedb628d6_1179x413.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Aot!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02f17312-1726-4bff-90ff-9d9bedb628d6_1179x413.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7Aot!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F02f17312-1726-4bff-90ff-9d9bedb628d6_1179x413.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FDfE!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8502a402-e1c8-4071-8c77-6774f85e1bed_1179x495.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FDfE!,w_1456,c_limit